// D16310: an un-annotated lambda at a field that is a union of a function type and a record:
// boxed under the field's function arm, so `is` on that arm holds.
// Format: scripts/capability-probes/README.md, "Template format".
// @@VALUE@@
{ f: () => true }
// @@TYPE@@
{ f: (() => boolean | i32) | { w: i32 } } | i64
// @@PROOF@@
if v is { f: (() => boolean | i32) | { w: i32 } } { print(v.f is () => boolean | i32) } else { print(false) }
// @@WANT@@
true
